    "text.67c48e87": "In the basic coin method, when one of the three coins differs, that one decides whether the line is yin or yang; when all three are the same, the line becomes a changing line. Rather than a simple majority vote, iYeok also reads this as a question: “In this combination, which quality is given the deciding voice?”",
